# Geotab

    > Geotab is a global leader in connected transportation technology, providing fleet management, telematics, and EV solutions to over 50,000 customers worldwide.

    ## Product Overview

    - [Fleet Management Solutions](https://www.geotab.com/fleet-management-solutions/): Core platform covering tracking, analytics, safety, and compliance
    - [All Solutions](https://www.geotab.com/all-solutions/): Complete product and solution catalogue
    - [Hardware Integration](https://www.geotab.com/fleet-management-solutions/hardware-integration/): Vehicle tracking hardware and third-party device integration

    ## Key Solutions

    - [Electric Vehicles](https://www.geotab.com/fleet-management-solutions/electric-vehicles/): EV fleet management and charging insights
    - [Fleet Safety](https://www.geotab.com/fleet-safety/): Safety scoring, coaching, and collision detection
    - [Compliance](https://www.geotab.com/fleet-management-solutions/compliance/): HOS, DVIR, and IFTA compliance tools
    - [Sustainability](https://www.geotab.com/fleet-management-solutions/sustainability/): Fleet emissions and sustainability reporting

